    honest: [["Some camps won't take under-5s","We tell you upfront. There are alternatives that do, and they're often better for small kids anyway."],["Game drives are early","5:30am starts. Kids are usually thrilled for the first two days. By day three we build in a rest morning."],["The migration is not guaranteed","We explain this clearly and set expectations before you land. The bush always delivers something — just not always the thing on the poster."],["It's physically big","Distances between experiences are real. Bush flights are non-negotiable for families — we don't do 8-hour overland with kids."]],
